      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-17T18:29:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In a video interview at Chicago Comic Con, I was asked who my favorite super hero was, and who my favorite super villain was.  I had to think, as they used to be other characters from other properties, but I wasn’t being “marketing guy” or at all facetious when I said “Absolute Zero” and “Citizen Dawn”.</p>\n<p>The only thing I might change, in retrospect, would be that my favorite is actually Fanatic.  But it’s so hard to choose!</p>",
