      "id": 21538,
      "name": "poorlydesigned",
      "username": "poorlydesigned",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b487fb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-23T17:39:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I still need to read the backstories.  I look forward to it!  Last night I played Tempest and Bunker for the first time.  Tempest can seriously whoop some butt!  Big fan!  My wife ran Haka and The Visionary, and we felt a little lost with Visionary.  She seemed to be able to do a lot to mix up the Villain deck, but not much to really affect battle.  Still, it was only our second game, and we were against Citizen Dawn.  So I’m sure we’ll figure it out.</p>",
