      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-23T19:19:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Christopher and I are actually of the opinion that The Visionary is probably the most powerful character in the game, but she has an unusual and (generally) low-damage play style that takes a bit to learn and will not be to every player’s taste.</p>",
